Credits
-------

The UI toolkit (.agent-kit/ui/ in an install; common/.agent-kit/ui/ in this repo) is inspired by
impeccable (https://github.com/pbakaus/impeccable, by pbakaus, Apache-2.0), which itself started
from Anthropic's frontend-design skill. Impeccable's platform references in turn draw on
ehmo/platform-design-skills (https://github.com/ehmo/platform-design-skills, MIT).

This is inspiration only. No code and no text was copied from impeccable, from
platform-design-skills or from the frontend-design skill. What the toolkit shares with them is
ideas: its working modes, the brand and product registers, and several themes of the "AI tells" it
checks for. The wording, the files and the code are this project's own, so none of those projects'
license notices apply to the files here.
